{"4250500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Protocol 86: Chernobyl", "steam_appid": 4250500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2>FILE: EMERGENCY_READ_ME_00.txt<br>DATE: 04.11.1991 | TIME: 23:58<br>USER: PETROV_P (ID: 4421-B)<br>STATUS: RESTRICTED_LOCAL_LINK<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified units have infiltrated the facility. Explosions are erupting, and red alarm logs are flooding the system one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can hear the boots in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams echo through the facility’s concrete walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came for us. I think they’re going to bury us beneath this concrete — along with every unknown and every secret we carry.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something repeatedly mentioned in the logs: <strong><i>TROYKA.</i></strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret Soviet underground research and experimentation facility established after the Chernobyl disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was believed to have completely collapsed after the great destruction and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this place is still standing. These concrete walls are still breathing — resting above thousands of graves beneath them.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this operation in the autumn of 1991 an attempt to bury the collapsing Soviets’ hidden crimes deep within history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or has the Cold War turned hot? Or is this the beginning of a new world war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don’t know what is happening out there.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must use the terminals to find the exit.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The .txt, .png, .wav, and .secret files within them are your only guides to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange things are happening here. Things I cannot explain — things you must witness with your own eyes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you hear the crackle of radiation behind the walls? The whispers? The approaching footsteps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. Hundreds of meters underground, between these cold walls, you are not alone. And you are certainly not safe.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the clues. Solve the puzzle. Find the way out. Survive.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hidden truths within these logs must rise to the surface with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These dark secrets must not be buried in history.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are reading this, know that no one before you has succeeded. Will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hahahaha. The others said the same thing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2>// WARNING: RADIATION LEAK DETECTED (LEVEL 4)<br>// CRITICAL: AIR PURIFICATION SYSTEM FAILED<br>// SIGNATURE: P. PETROV - Maintenance Engineer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>uid-0x17@unit-2:~$</strong>  protocol86 is booting... [OK]</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Alternate History:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bleak atmosphere filled with tension and horror. Under relentless psychological pressure, can you solve the puzzles and preserve your sanity? Or will you end up like the others?</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Procedural Sectors:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of claustrophobic sectors shifting procedurally.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Terminal:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dozens of commands such as <strong>'<i>ls</i>'</strong>, <strong>'<i>math</i>'</strong>, <strong>'<i>unit</i>'</strong>, and <strong>'<i>exit</i>'</strong>. Type <strong>'<i>help</i>'</strong> to begin, and use <strong>'<i>&lt;command&gt; --help</i>'</strong> to learn more about each command.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Secret Files:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List files with 'ls'. Discover their contents with '<i>read</i>'.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2>FILE: EMERGENCY_READ_ME_00.txt<br>DATE: 04.11.1991 | TIME: 23:58<br>USER: PETROV_P (ID: 4421-B)<br>STATUS: RESTRICTED_LOCAL_LINK<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified units have infiltrated the facility. Explosions are erupting, and red alarm logs are flooding the system one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can hear the boots in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams echo through the facility’s concrete walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came for us. I think they’re going to bury us beneath this concrete — along with every unknown and every secret we carry.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something repeatedly mentioned in the logs: <strong><i>TROYKA.</i></strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret Soviet underground research and experimentation facility established after the Chernobyl disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was believed to have completely collapsed after the great destruction and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this place is still standing. These concrete walls are still breathing — resting above thousands of graves beneath them.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this operation in the autumn of 1991 an attempt to bury the collapsing Soviets’ hidden crimes deep within history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or has the Cold War turned hot? Or is this the beginning of a new world war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don’t know what is happening out there.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must use the terminals to find the exit.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The .txt, .png, .wav, and .secret files within them are your only guides to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange things are happening here. Things I cannot explain — things you must witness with your own eyes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you hear the crackle of radiation behind the walls? The whispers? The approaching footsteps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. Hundreds of meters underground, between these cold walls, you are not alone. And you are certainly not safe.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the clues. Solve the puzzle. Find the way out. Survive.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hidden truths within these logs must rise to the surface with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These dark secrets must not be buried in history.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are reading this, know that no one before you has succeeded. Will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hahahaha. The others said the same thing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2>// WARNING: RADIATION LEAK DETECTED (LEVEL 4)<br>// CRITICAL: AIR PURIFICATION SYSTEM FAILED<br>// SIGNATURE: P. PETROV - Maintenance Engineer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=========================================</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>uid-0x17@unit-2:~$</strong>  protocol86 is booting... [OK]</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Alternate History:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bleak atmosphere filled with tension and horror. Under relentless psychological pressure, can you solve the puzzles and preserve your sanity? Or will you end up like the others?</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Procedural Sectors:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of claustrophobic sectors shifting procedurally.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Terminal:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dozens of commands such as <strong>'<i>ls</i>'</strong>, <strong>'<i>math</i>'</strong>, <strong>'<i>unit</i>'</strong>, and <strong>'<i>exit</i>'</strong>. Type <strong>'<i>help</i>'</strong> to begin, and use <strong>'<i>&lt;command&gt; --help</i>'</strong> to learn more about each command.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Secret Files:</strong></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List files with 'ls'. Discover their contents with '<i>read</i>'.</p>", "short_description": "A terminal-driven psychological horror puzzle set in a secret Soviet underground research facility built after the 1986 Chernobyl disaster. Survive in procedurally shifting sectors using only the terminal. Type ‘help’ to begin.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250500/e551169a1b924ce89359af5d01f071d28f82f977/header.jpg?t=1776832496", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250500/ce0d21c100bc24a218914d5c3bdfdb99347f4b66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776832496", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250500/ce0d21c100bc24a218914d5c3bdfdb99347f4b66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776832496", "website": "https://core-interactive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Core Interactive"], "publishers": ["Core I